(7550540, 1209349, 182284, '<td valign="top">I live in a National Park and the new superintendent had all the wild life poisoned because of health issues. She got rid of the public restrooms and any native plants that needed tending. So sad. I love this photo.</td>', 'I live in a National Park and the new superintendent had all the wild life poisoned because of health issues. She got rid of the public restrooms and any native plants that needed tending. So sad. I love this photo.', '2018-01-01 01:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
