(7550930, 1209605, 61396, '<td valign="top">for me it''s best when it happens mostly in my head, so thanks, and sorry for missing out voting.</td>', 'for me it''s best when it happens mostly in my head, so thanks, and sorry for missing out voting.', '2018-01-03 06:58:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7550931, 1209301, 61396, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> wish I had voted. this is a gorgeous breakthrough of spirit. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>exactly</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: wish I had voted. this is a gorgeous breakthrough of spirit.  exactly', '2018-01-03 06:59:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7550940, 1209546, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>A great action shot Ronnie. The focus is lovely and crisp and sharp exactly where it matters, those eyes are superb. The prey being so small is a little difficult to distinguish at first but you''re timing is spot on. As far as the challenge is concerned it does meet the challenge it is a bird with wings however, I think a shot where the wings are more obvious may have rewarded you even more but nevertheless its still a good image, well done and Happy New Year to you.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well A great action shot Ronnie. The focus is lovely and crisp and sharp exactly where it matters, those eyes are superb. The prey being so small is a little difficult to distinguish at first but you''re timing is spot on. As far as the challenge is concerned it does meet the challenge it is a bird with wings however, I think a shot where the wings are more obvious may have rewarded you even more but nevertheless its still a good image, well done and Happy New Year to you.', '2018-01-03 10:47:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(7550941, 1209472, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>Congratulations Anton on your ribbon, a splendid result for a splendid image. I love the pose, it works so well especially with the challenge theme in mind. I realise you were taking this in the golden hour in diminishing light but as has already been commented a little more exposure would have really made the whites of this gorgeous bird really stand out magnificently. What a great start to the year for you, Happy New year and continued success to you.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well Congratulations Anton on your ribbon, a splendid result for a splendid image. I love the pose, it works so well especially with the challenge theme in mind. I realise you were taking this in the golden hour in diminishing light but as has already been commented a little more exposure would have really made the whites of this gorgeous bird really stand out magnificently. What a great start to the year for you, Happy New year and continued success to you.', '2018-01-03 10:52:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7550942, 1209523, 62357, '<td valign="top">Deb, so pleased to see this in the top five.</td>', 'Deb, so pleased to see this in the top five.', '2018-01-03 12:36:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7550943, 1209523, 30214, '<td valign="top">Great catch Deb, congratulations! The wide angle and large DOF that come with cellphone cameras "for free" worked well for you.</td>', 'Great catch Deb, congratulations! The wide angle and large DOF that come with cellphone cameras "for free" worked well for you.', '2018-01-03 13:07:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7550945, 1209557, 80096, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 6 - thought this was very clever!</td>', 'I gave you a 6 - thought this was very clever!', '2018-01-03 13:13:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7550946, 1209349, 2158, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> I think without the food being there, it would have been more "natural" and I''d have scored it higher. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It was "natural" because this pigeon was having a great time playing with his food, as seen in my outtake:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1209969" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/2158/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1209969.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/2158/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1209969.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/2158/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1209969.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I nearly entered that one but wasn''t happy with it from a technical point of view.</td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: I think without the food being there, it would have been more "natural" and I''d have scored it higher.   It was "natural" because this pigeon was having a great time playing with his food, as seen in my outtake:  I nearly entered that one but wasn''t happy with it from a technical point of view.', '2018-01-03 13:24:05.000000', NULL, 0),
